      "line": "🌒 Dusk. They come out of the treeline in a knot — 3 of them, thin and road-worn — and stop at the edge of your firelight like they're not sure they're allowed closer. The oldest steps forward. \"Maya Lindqvist. From Stonebridge.\" A pause. \"We're asking for a fire.\""
    },
